:patient_age rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
             rdfs:subPropertyOf owl:topDataProperty ;
             rdfs:domain :Incident ;
             rdfs:range xsd:integer .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#patient_sex
:patient_sex rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
             rdfs:subPropertyOf owl:topDataProperty ;
             rdfs:domain :Incident ;
             rdfs:range xsd:string .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#probability
:probability rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
             rdfs:subPropertyOf owl:topDataProperty ;
             rdfs:domain :Risk ;
             rdfs:range xsd:string .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#regulatory_framework
:regulatory_framework rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                      rdfs:subPropertyOf owl:topDataProperty ;
                      rdfs:domain :Device ;
                      rdfs:range xsd:string .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/polina/ontologies/2026/3/untitled-ontology-16#report_date
:report_date rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
             rdfs:subPropertyOf owl:topDataProperty ;
             rdfs:domain :Incident ;
             rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .


